{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52822","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 李岩","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远节忘荣趣，全真悟道微。\n登朝四皓客，辞老二疏归。\n圣主钦玄德，台臣饯羽衣。\n丹丘不可接，凫舄几时飞。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}